{"4535680":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"am I STILL me","steam_appid":4535680,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4779620],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short Description<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain forbidden power. Reshape your build. Risk losing yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy deckbuilding roguelite where corruption makes you stronger — and determines how your story ends.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In am I STILL me, power always comes at a price.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark fantasy deckbuilding roguelite where you grow stronger by embracing corruption. Every choice can reshape your deck, your strategy, and ultimately your ending.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck from 180+ cards, discover powerful combinations, and adapt through tense turn-based battles. Summon allies, exploit status effects, and create devastating synergies that push your build in different directions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every gain has consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more power you take, the more your mind and body begin to change. Corruption can unlock greater strength, but it also pulls you closer to losing who you are.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go for power?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when it’s over... will you still be yourself?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark fantasy deckbuilding roguelite gameplay shaped by player choice<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build and refine unique decks from 180+ cards<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create different playstyles through cards, dark powers, and corruption<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based battles focused on synergy, risk, and adaptation<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use corruption as a source of power — at the cost of your selfhood<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings base